 "best_diff": "--- initial\n+++ best\n@@ -11,16 +11,18 @@\n \n     Vectors need not be normalized (the evaluator normalizes them), but none may be\n     zero. The score is the minimum angle in degrees between any two points. This\n-    start draws uniformly random points with a fixed seed, so some pairs end up\n-    close together.\n+    start uses Fibonacci sphere for uniform distribution.\n     \"\"\"\n-    rng = random.Random(1)\n+    # Fibonacci sphere initialization for uniform distribution\n+    phi0 = 0.0\n     points = []\n-    for _ in range(n):\n-        z = rng.uniform(-1.0, 1.0)\n-        phi = rng.uniform(0.0, 2 * math.pi)\n-        s = math.sqrt(1.0 - z * z)\n-        points.append((s * math.cos(phi), s * math.sin(phi), z))\n+    for i in range(n):\n+        y = 1 - (2 * i) / (n - 1)\n+        theta = math.acos(y)\n+        phi = phi0 + 2 * math.pi * (i + 0.5) / n\n+        phi0 += 2 * math.pi / n\n+        s = math.sqrt(1.0 - y * y)\n+        points.append((s * math.cos(phi), s * math.sin(phi), y))\n     return points\n # OMEGA-BLOCK-END\n \n",
